WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000022760 — Episode 19 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.280
You've got to be kidding me. Moving on to your next target already?

2
00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:06.160
You waste absolutely no time, do you?

3
00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:08.080
What are you talking about? Let me go!

4
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.760
So you can keep flirting with that Elk?

5
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:20.480
Didn't Maran tell you? Dragons are the absolute best in bed.

6
00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:24.720
Now that you've had a taste of me, who else could possibly satisfy you?

7
00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:30.240
You arrogant, shameless jerk! Let me go!

8
00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.240
You've got terrible taste, Lyra.

9
00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:35.360
What exactly does that Elk have that I don't?

10
00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:37.440
Can he make your knees weak the way I can?

11
00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:43.920
Your Majesty, if I may, I don't know what happened between the two of you.

12
00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:46.080
Ms. Vos is a delicate human guest.

13
00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:50.560
Perhaps your Majesty might show the grace expected for a king.

14
00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:54.720
Grace? That's just what useless men call weakness.

15
00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:59.680
Your Majesty, if you have something against me, take it out on me.

16
00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:06.720
Mr. Lawn is kind and humble. With all due respect, you have no right to insult him.

17
00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:11.680
Well, well, well. Never in dragon history has his Majesty been scolded like this

18
00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:15.920
by a tiny human lady. Fascinating.

19
00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:23.650
That pathetic human bitch actually dared to come back.

20
00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:28.130
This time, I'll make sure she never leaves alive.
